oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file Makefile kept 6
| # The second recipe is expanded after the first one has run, so both the
| # wildcard and the shell call in it see the file the first recipe made.
| all: second
| first: ; @printf 'made\n' > made
| second: first ; @printf '[%s] [%s]\n' '$(wildcard made)' '$(shell cat made 2>/dev/null)' > out
| .PHONY: all first second
file made touched 1
| made
file out touched 1
| [made] [made]
